## 4. Nil-deref / missing branches

| Item | Status |
|------|--------|
| **A1** `clean_cursor` after single-card miss | Matches stack miss path — fixes stuck `is_dragging`. |
| **A5** `slot_invalid` stack branch | Mirrors `invalid_card` — correct. |
| **A4** `occupy_slot` → `is_empty = false` | Fixes false `slot_valid` on occupied columns. |
| **A5 without `pending_drop`** | No-op (same as before). |
| **Single-card miss `self.selected_card`** | No nil guard if `is_dragging` true but `selected_card` nil — corrupt state only. |

**A5 nit:** `slot_invalid` does not clear `pending_drop` before `clean_cursor` — harmless since `clean_cursor` nils it.

